#: src/reference/concepts/sbt-query.md:1
msgid "sbt query"
msgstr "sbt query"

#: src/reference/concepts/sbt-query.md:4
msgid "sbt 2.x extends the slash syntax to enable aggregation of subprojects:"
msgstr "sbt 2.x 扩展了斜杠语法以支持子项目聚合："

#: src/reference/concepts/sbt-query.md:6
msgid ""
"_act_ `::=` \\[ _query_ `/` \\] \\[ _config_ `/` \\] \\[ _in-task_ `/` \\] "
"( _taskKey_ | _settingKey_ )"
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/concepts/sbt-query.md:8
msgid "In other words, sbt query is a new way of writing the subproject-axis."
msgstr "换言之，sbt query 是编写子项目轴的新方式。"

#: src/reference/concepts/sbt-query.md:10
msgid "Subproject reference"
msgstr "子项目引用"

#: src/reference/concepts/sbt-query.md:12
msgid "A subproject reference works as a query to select the subproject:"
msgstr "子项目引用作为查询来选择子项目："

#: src/reference/concepts/sbt-query.md:14
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"````admonish example title='build.sbt example 1'\n"
"```scala\n"
"scalaVersion := \"3.8.4\"\n"
"\n"
"lazy val foo = project\n"
"```\n"
"````"
msgstr ""
"````admonish example title='build.sbt 示例 1'\n"
"```scala\n"
"scalaVersion := \"3.8.1\"\n"
"\n"
"lazy val foo = project\n"
"```\n"
"````"

#: src/reference/concepts/sbt-query.md:22
msgid ""
"Given the above build, we can run tests on `foo` subproject as follows, "
"which is the same syntax as it was in sbt 1.x:"
msgstr ""
"对于上述构建，我们可以按以下方式在 `foo` 子项目上运行测试，语法与 sbt 1.x 相"
"同："

#: src/reference/concepts/sbt-query.md:28
msgid "`...` wildcard"
msgstr "`...` 通配符"

#: src/reference/concepts/sbt-query.md:30
msgid ""
"`...` wildcard matches to any characters, and can be combined with other "
"letters and numbers to filter down the root aggregate list. For example, we "
"can run tests on all subproject that starts with `foo` as follows:"
msgstr ""
"`...` 通配符可匹配任意字符，并可与其他字母和数字组合以筛选根聚合列表。例如，"
"我们可以按以下方式在所有以 `foo` 开头的子项目上运行测试："

#: src/reference/concepts/sbt-query.md:36
msgid ""
"```admonish note title='Note: * vs ...'\n"
"sbt query intentionally uses `...` (dot dot dot) instead of more intuitive "
"`*` (asterisk) because `*` is often used in a shell as a wildcard to match "
"existing files or directories. This would require quoting, and forgetting to "
"quote `*/test` would match to something like `src/test`.\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```admonish note title='注意：* 与 ...'\n"
"sbt query 有意使用 `...`（省略号）而非更直观的 `*`（星号），因为 `*` 在 "
"shell 中常被用作通配符来匹配现有文件或目录。这需要加引号，而忘记给 `*/test` "
"加引号会匹配到类似 `src/test` 的内容。\n"
"```"

#: src/reference/concepts/sbt-query.md:40
msgid "`@scalaBinaryVersion` parameter"
msgstr "`@scalaBinaryVersion` 参数"

#: src/reference/concepts/sbt-query.md:42
msgid ""
"`@scalaBinaryVersion` parameter matches to the subproject's "
"`scalaBinaryVersion` setting."
msgstr "`@scalaBinaryVersion` 参数与子项目的 `scalaBinaryVersion` 设置匹配。"

#: src/reference/concepts/sbt-query.md:44
msgid ""
"````admonish example\n"
"```scala\n"
"val toolkitV = \"0.5.0\"\n"
"val toolkit = \"org.scala-lang\" %% \"toolkit\" % toolkitV\n"
"\n"
"lazy val foo = projectMatrix\n"
"  .settings(\n"
"    libraryDependencies += toolkit,\n"
"  )\n"
"  .jvmPlatform(scalaVersions = Seq(\"3.8.4\", \"2.13.18\"))\n"
"\n"
"lazy val bar = projectMatrix\n"
"  .settings(\n"
"    libraryDependencies += toolkit,\n"
"  )\n"
"  .jvmPlatform(scalaVersions = Seq(\"3.8.4\", \"2.13.18\"))\n"
"```\n"
"````"
msgstr ""

